<Base title="Privacy Policy | CupToGram" description="CupToGram privacy information." path="/privacy/"><main class="wrap content"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Last updated: October 18, 2026</p><p>CupToGram is designed to work without accounts or a site-owned database. Calculator inputs are processed in your browser and are not submitted to a CupToGram application server.</p><h2>Hosting and analytics</h2><p>The site may use Cloudflare hosting and, if enabled, Cloudflare Web Analytics. Hosting providers may process technical information needed to deliver and protect the site.</p><h2>Advertising</h2><p>If Google AdSense is enabled after approval, Google and its partners may use cookies or similar technologies to serve, measure, and personalize ads according to their policies and applicable consent requirements. Advertising will remain disabled until configured by the site owner.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can control cookies through your browser and review Google advertising settings where available. Update this page to reflect the final analytics, advertising, consent, and jurisdictional setup before launch.</p></main></Base>